1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,074
5 things you must never do in
Turkmenistan.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:08,624
Don’t photograph police stations,
airports, or government buildings.

3
00:00:10,274 --> 00:00:13,273
Don’t stay more than 3 working days
without registering.

4
00:00:14,923 --> 00:00:18,274
Don’t smoke outside, except in marked
smoking areas.

5
00:00:19,924 --> 00:00:23,010
Don’t buy a carpet without its export
certificate.

6
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:27,892
Don’t drive a dirty car in Ashgabat. The
police can fine you.
